{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Develop a “Why Choose Us” section for a Shopify store.
    
    The section should feature benefit cards that each include:
    
    A custom icon (upload or select from icon list)
    
    A bold title
    
    A short supporting description
    
    Functional Requirements:
    
    Allow the user to add, remove, and reorder cards dynamically from the theme editor (unlimited blocks).
    
    Each card block should have these settings:
    
    Icon (image upload)
    
    Title (text)
    
    Description (rich text)
    
    Background color
    
    Text color
    
    Optional link (for future use)
    
    Layout Settings for the whole section:
    
    Control how many cards per row (1–4 columns)
    
    Control card size (small, medium, large — adjusts padding and width)
    
    Card alignment (left, center, justified)
    
    Spacing between cards (horizontal & vertical)
    
    Card border radius and optional hover animation (lift/shadow)
    
    Section padding top and bottom
    
    Responsive layout: cards stack vertically on mobile
    
    Design style:
    
    Clean, modern, minimal — matching Horizon theme style.
    
    Default: 4 cards in a 2x2 grid with icons centered.
    
    Cards should expand equally in row width., Develop a “Why Choose Us” section for a Shopify store.
    
